WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.973
- So I propose this,

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.483
you and I fight one man and one man.

00:00:06.727 --> 00:00:09.381
We fight in our armies stead.

00:00:09.381 --> 00:00:10.460
If I lose,

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:11.293
my men will leave

00:00:11.293 --> 00:00:13.420
this place forthwith and forever.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:14.520
You will have my head.

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:17.010
If I win,

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:18.550
I will assume this kingdom's crown

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:19.800
upon your father's death.

00:00:25.226 --> 00:00:26.683
What say you?

00:00:28.988 --> 00:00:31.783
- Are you scared you're angry?

00:00:33.932 --> 00:00:35.979
- What say you?

00:00:35.979 --> 00:00:38.565
- Are you scared of this battle?

00:00:38.565 --> 00:00:40.483
There is no shame of it.

00:00:41.388 --> 00:00:43.566
- Save your men.

00:00:43.566 --> 00:00:45.283
- You save your own men.

00:00:47.131 --> 00:00:50.990
You came here to me!

00:00:50.990 --> 00:00:52.483
Surrender to me!

00:00:54.475 --> 00:00:56.363
- I cannot do that.

00:00:57.843 --> 00:00:58.883
- Well then boy,

00:00:59.983 --> 00:01:01.470
let us make famous

00:01:02.518 --> 00:01:04.263
that field out there.

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:07.523
This little village of Agincourt.

00:01:08.733 --> 00:01:12.323
That will forever mark the
site of your callow disgrace.

00:01:13.729 --> 00:01:18.300
(metal clinking)

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:23.300
(suspenseful music)

00:01:31.915 --> 00:01:35.582
(speaking foreign language)

00:01:39.515 --> 00:01:42.087
- Archers.
- Archers!

00:01:42.087 --> 00:01:44.420
(suspenseful music)

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:46.753
- Archers!
- Now.

00:01:47.767 --> 00:01:49.577
- Draw!
- Draw!

00:01:49.577 --> 00:01:52.470
(suspenseful music)

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:54.153
- Loose!

00:01:54.153 --> 00:01:56.986
(arrows pinging)

00:02:00.245 --> 00:02:03.476
(horses neighing)
(arrows smacking)

00:02:03.476 --> 00:02:08.476
(men yelling)

00:02:13.429 --> 00:02:18.211
- [Knight] Halt, break.

00:02:18.211 --> 00:02:22.508
(men yelling)

00:02:22.508 --> 00:02:27.008
(suspenseful music)

00:02:34.291 --> 00:02:36.874
